OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786898895
OL,3,CFamilies see their fire-destroyed
OL,4,Chomes after three days
OL,6,FAt least eight families have been able
OL,7,Fto see their homes for the first time
OL,8,Fafter a huge fire destroyed and
OL,9,Fseverely damaged nearly 40 houses in
OL,10,FStourbridge.
OL,12,FA grass fire at Stourbridge Golf Club
OL,13,Fspread to homes on Thursday,
OL,14,Fdestroying 19 homes and damaging 18
OL,15,Fothers.
OL,17,FInvestigators are still working on
OL,18,Fwhat caused the blaze.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786898895
OL,3,CFamilies see their fire-destroyed
OL,4,Chomes after three days
OL,6,FSome of the worst areas include
OL,7,FBrunswick Avenue, Landsgate, Ounty
OL,8,FJohn Lane, Quarry Park Road and
OL,9,FRacecourse Lane.
OL,11,FWest Midlands Fire Service has been
OL,12,Fmeeting with families on theses roads
OL,13,Fone by one to discuss the damage and,
OL,14,Fif safe to do so, show them their
OL,15,Fhomes.
OL,17,FOf the 19 destroyed homes, at least
OL,18,Feight families have been able to view
OL,19,Ftheir homes, assisted by the fire
OL,20,Fservice at Dudley Council.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786898895
OL,3,CFamilies see their fire-destroyed
OL,4,Chomes after three days
OL,6,FThe MP for Stourbridge, Cat Eccles,
OL,7,Ftold ITV Central that they're ready to
OL,8,Fsupport families with the mental
OL,9,Fhealth impact the fire may bring.
OL,11,FShe said: "There is a lot of smoke,
OL,12,Fit's very smelly.
OL,14,F"We're also warning people that their
OL,15,Fstreet may look very different to how
OL,16,Fthey remember it from a few days ago
OL,17,Fand I think in the coming days we're
OL,18,Fgoing to have to be supporting people
OL,19,Fa lot with the psychological impact of
OL,20,Fthese fires.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786898895
OL,3,CFamilies see their fire-destroyed
OL,4,Chomes after three days
OL,6,F"At the Town Hall through the council,
OL,7,Fthere's been mental health support
OL,8,Foffered. We're really grateful to some
OL,9,Flocal trained councillors that have
OL,10,Fbeen offering their services free of
OL,11,Fcharge.
OL,13,F"I think it's going to be a very long
OL,14,Frecovery for people, it's not going to
OL,15,Fbe linear."
OL,17,FOn Friday, there was anger from
OL,18,Fresidents after rumours a meeting was
OL,19,Fto be held at Stourbridge Golf Club,
OL,20,Fwhich did not happen.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786898895
OL,3,CFamilies see their fire-destroyed
OL,4,Chomes after three days
OL,6,FCat Eccles said: "We can always
OL,7,Fimprove communications and that's
OL,8,Fgoing to be a learning point going
OL,9,Fforward.
OL,11,FFire crews are expected to start
OL,12,Fstanding down at the main cordon, at
OL,13,Fthe junction of Racecourse Lane and
OL,14,FWorcester Lane from Monday.
OL,16,FWest Midlands Fire Service says the
OL,17,Fblaze is now completely under control
OL,18,Fin Stourbridge as some crews remain at
OL,19,Fthe scene dampening down.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786898895
OL,3,CFamilies see their fire-destroyed
OL,4,Chomes after three days
OL,6,FAlmost all the roads in the affected
OL,7,Farea are now reopen. Those include
OL,8,FNorton Road and the roads off it.
OL,10,FOf around the 130 properties affected,
OL,11,Fpeople have been able to return home
OL,12,Fto around 106 properties.
OL,14,FChief Fire Officer Simon Tuhill told
OL,15,FITV Central what it's been like to
OL,16,Ftackle a fire of this magnitude.
OL,18,FHe said: "I was at the scene
OL,19,Frelatively quickly on Thursday and I
OL,20,Fsaw just how challenge the conditions
OL,21,Fwere.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786898895
OL,3,CFamilies see their fire-destroyed
OL,4,Chomes after three days
OL,6,F"The smoke was extensive an the fire
OL,7,Fwas travelling rapidly. I was speaking
OL,8,Fto firefighters who were absolutely
OL,9,Fdoing their best to try and prevent it
OL,10,Fspreading to people's property."
OL,12,FDudley Council said they've been
OL,13,Finundated with donations from local
OL,14,Fpeople at the Town Hall and are asking
OL,15,Ffor no more donations.
OL,17,FThey're directing people to their
OL,18,Fofficial Crowdfunding page to support
OL,19,Fthose effected. So far, it has
OL,20,Fsurpassed #31,000.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786898895
OL,3,CFamilies see their fire-destroyed
OL,4,Chomes after three days
OL,6,FThey've also asking locals to be
OL,7,Fcautious when sharing or donating
OL,8,Fonline appeals that may be fake.
OL,10,FOne woman has set up a fundraiser
OL,11,Fwhich has raised more than #9,000.
OL,13,FDi Wood founded Leslie's Care Packages
OL,14,F10 years ago. She'll using the money
OL,15,Fto buy supermarket gift cards to give
OL,16,Fto effected families.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
