PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786898895
OL,3,CFamilies see their fire-destroyed
OL,4,Chomes after three days
OL,6,FDi said: "They will be handed out to
OL,7,Fpeople who have lost their properties.
OL,8,FSo they will be turned in to clothing,
OL,9,Ffood, some electrical items, and I'm
OL,10,Fcovering Stourbridge, Birmingham and
OL,11,Fanywhere where people have lost
OL,12,Feverything."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/9
